Comment: Runtime dependencies (not shipped in this package):
 GTK 4 (libgtk-4-1), GLib, Pango, GdkPixbuf: LGPL-2.1+; Cairo: LGPL-2.1
 or MPL-1.1; PolicyKit: LGPL-2.0+; glibc: LGPL-2.1+. They are linked
 dynamically and provided by the distribution.
 .
 Programs run as separate processes and not shipped: pkexec, apt-get or
 dnf (update install), systemctl, which, timeout, sh, xdg-open and the
 desktop PDF viewer.
 .
 Credits / inspiration (not shipped, no source code included):
 QDiskInfo - GPL-3.0 - https://github.com/edisionnano/QDiskInfo
 SMART disk-info UI/logic reimplemented independently in Rust+GTK4.
 .
